00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:02.780
Like, he doesn't care about me.

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:05.790
Then I just kinda feel
lonely and stuff like that.

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:08.220
These days, I let just
god handle vengeance.

00:11:08.220 --> 00:11:10.030
I feel like it played out a lot better.

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:12.000
There are times where
I'm like, really tempted

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:15.980
to do something to somebody that hurts me

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:19.440
but I'm just really tired of the karma.

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:21.140
Just 'cause it comes
back to me every time.

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:24.060
Like, there's never been a time
where I didn't get it back.

00:11:24.060 --> 00:11:25.430
You know?

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:26.263
So, yeah.

00:11:27.713 --> 00:11:30.820
- I don't think that a lot
of people would believe

00:11:30.820 --> 00:11:35.820
that I was in a women's jail,
detention center, prisoner.

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:43.730
Arrested for domestic
violence against a woman

00:11:43.730 --> 00:11:46.013
that I was in a relationship with.

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:52.820
I pulled a knife out and
threatened her with it.

00:11:55.597 --> 00:12:00.000
And it cost me a lot of things in my life.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:05.000
The humiliation, the shame
behind it was something

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.543
that I still carry with me.

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:12.120
But I was able to make amends for it.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:17.120
The other thing is that
I was drunk and on drugs

00:12:19.040 --> 00:12:22.730
when that happened and that
I'm now clean and sober.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:24.980
Now I've turned my life around.

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:28.940
And I am happy, joyous, and free.

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:31.063
And my life is such a blessing.

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:33.463
And I'm super happy.

00:12:35.490 --> 00:12:37.130
- Hey everyone, Thor.Aya, here.

00:12:37.130 --> 00:12:40.160
I wanted to say thank you
for watching this episode.

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:42.270
I am still selling these
sweaters on my website.

00:12:42.270 --> 00:12:43.220
If you're interested, I'll link in

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.390
in my description.

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:47.998
I love you guys and
I'll see you next week.

00:12:47.998 --> 00:12:50.248
(soft music)

